OL,3,GNEWSAGreat markets 'don't need flashy  
OL,4,Aadvertising'                           
OL,6,FA great market is not built with fairy 
OL,7,Flights or flashy advertising, according
OL,8,Fto the head of the UK's market industry
OL,9,Fbody. It is built by reflecting the    
OL,10,Fpeople who use it.                     
OL,12,FThe comments come after the            
OL,13,Fcancellation of the Kernow Christmas   
OL,14,FMarket in Pool, Cornwall, following a  
OL,15,Fbacklash over AI-generated promotional 
OL,16,Fimages that visitors and traders said  
OL,17,Fdid not match the reality of the event.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
