OL,3,GNEWSAGreat markets 'don't need flashy  
OL,4,Aadvertising'                           
OL,6,FFor David Catterall, chief executive of
OL,7,Fthe National Association of British    
OL,8,FMarket Authorities, authenticity is the
OL,9,Fingredient shared by successful markets
OL,10,Facross the country.                    
OL,12,F"What makes a great market is that they
OL,13,Frepresent the community that they're   
OL,14,Fserving," he said.                     
